WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:06.131
I see you have another guest.

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:07.132
Oh, no.

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:08.925
Milady!

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.511
Lady Tsuyuko!

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:12.429
Lady Tsuyuko!

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:16.891
Lady Tsuyuko!

00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:19.436
I found this bug at the Shinsen Temple!

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:21.604
Thank you, Kerao.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:25.442
A little praying mantis.
There's something different about it.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:27.944
Lady Tsuyuko, have a look at mine!

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:32.449
The snail has an inverted shell.
Excellent work, Amahiko.

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:34.993
And Inagomaro?

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:39.956
That insect that you found by the river?
I named it Splishy-Splash!

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:42.792
Splishy-Splash?

00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:47.130
Oh? And who might you be?

00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:52.302
He's already this big?

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:54.679
Isn't he a marvel?

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.807
I can't wait to see what he'll grow into.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.436
He will become evil.

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:03.313
After all, he's a sekisanko.

00:01:03.813 --> 00:01:05.023
A sekisanko?

00:01:05.648 --> 00:01:09.110
An insect spirit born from kodoku magic.

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:12.572
Once out of its cocoon,
it uses lethal curses to kill.

00:01:13.698 --> 00:01:15.992
Kill who?

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:18.578
Whoever you hate

00:01:18.661 --> 00:01:20.830
because you're the one who raised it.

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:24.501
But I don't hate anyone.

00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:29.839
Deep inside every human,
there exists a dark soul.

00:01:30.673 --> 00:01:34.677
A sekisanko is a vicious spirit
that can sense your darkest secrets.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.847
Let me exorcise him before he pupates.

00:01:38.473 --> 00:01:39.349
Wait!

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.060
Don't be so quick to judge!

00:01:43.812 --> 00:01:46.314
Kuromaru is precious to me.

00:01:46.856 --> 00:01:49.442
I know it's hard for you to understand.

00:01:51.194 --> 00:01:55.990
You're an ignorant fool, incapable
of understanding the human heart!

00:01:58.368 --> 00:02:01.329
Then allow me to be there when he emerges.

00:02:01.371 --> 00:02:03.998
If I see that he's evil,
I'll exorcise him.

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:05.542
Will you agree to that?

00:02:06.543 --> 00:02:08.336
Thank you, Lord Seimei.

00:02:09.546 --> 00:02:10.505
Please do so.

